profile:
Nagasaki is a Christian hardcore band from Brisbane Australia which formed in 1999. 
Nagasaki is Charlie Thompson - vocals, Mikey Mann - drums, Andy Mackay - guitar, Steve Mackay - bass.

- In 1999 they recorded there first demo tape entitled "demolisten";
- Went on hiatus in early 2000;
- Reformed in April of 2000 with new drummer Mikey Mann & released "Sticks and Stones/Stand" Single;
- January 2001 Nagasaki played to there largest crowd at Sonfest;
